{"data":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091008914779431373","created_at":"2026-08-22T03:45:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091008914779431373"],"id":"2091008914779431373","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1594,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"某人的 https://t.co/LgEe3yxh2L","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091008914779431373"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2091004503915155792","created_at":"2026-08-22T03:28:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091004503915155792"],"id":"2091004503915155792","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":4174,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2087747837698494509","type":"quoted"}],"text":"我一直在说投资是件件极其简单的事情，比如24年1月附近买入2000美元的黄金，24年9月底抄底A股科技股，再比如今年6月份买入1500多U的以太坊，都是很容易拿到大结果的。\n如果你的交易还很犹豫还很纠结，就不要做了，大道往往至简！ https://t.co/YDDXvUEOXX","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2091004503915155792"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090995641245995215","created_at":"2026-08-22T02:53:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090995641245995215"],"id":"2090995641245995215","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7434,"like_count":9,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"以太坊的币本位多单是在1500多的开的，后来在1800附近加仓过1次，今早先平掉啦，现货还1个没出！ https://t.co/iGIBFvm8sE","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2090995641245995215"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090990864202129751","created_at":"2026-08-22T02:34:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090990864202129751"],"id":"2090990864202129751","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":857,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"事情认知低的人需要情绪价值，认知高的人需要精神价值，情绪价值可以哄骗，精神价值，只能靠共鸣。\n送给今天删掉我的一位推友，祝你早日完成自我救赎！","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2090990864202129751"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090986287968960774","created_at":"2026-08-22T02:15:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090986287968960774"],"id":"2090986287968960774","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":822,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"之前分享都是一些很形而上或者功利的东西，接下来我打算分享一些生活的部分。\n有幸几年和一群全球最顶尖的玩咖们在一起，很多都是全球的二代或者创业成功的精英人士，在那段时间时间才知道这个世界的鸿沟那么大，很多你现在玩的或者正流行的，可能是人家10年前玩过的！","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2090986287968960774"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090986135497609720","created_at":"2026-08-22T02:15:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090986135497609720"],"id":"2090986135497609720","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":8875,"like_count":18,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"世间好的东西几乎都不流通，上等的人和物，赤诚的真心，优质的资源，稀缺的机遇，从来不会铺满市井供人挑选，一旦出现就会被足够识货的人收入囊中，然后再也不在市面上流通。\n珍贵本就自带门槛，真正顶级珍贵的，永远小众、闭塞，极少流入大众视野。\n短时间不打算再加人呢，之前留微信的会会慢慢消化。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2090986135497609720"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090982718884794840","created_at":"2026-08-22T02:01:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090982718884794840"],"id":"2090982718884794840","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":4275,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"突然发现身边的人都好好，最近见识了太多奇葩事，好的人真的吸引好的人，并互相坚定走下去，这需要很大的智慧跟勇气，但大多数人没有！\n爱情能否幸福的本质是你要找到一个本身就很好的人，而不是只对你好，更不用说利用人性的弱点和你的善良把你框住！\n一般人看到这种人，即使再大的利益，都会远离！ https://t.co/2z0iMLRgQf","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2090982718884794840"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090963638433804577","created_at":"2026-08-22T00:45:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090963638433804577"],"id":"2090963638433804577","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":863,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"性感女人无处不在。真正成功、有自律、脚踏实地的男人却凤毛麟角。\n\n与其追逐认可，不如锤