66598880690338"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090449674620801098","created_at":"2026-08-20T14:43:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090449674620801098"],"id":"2090449674620801098","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3202,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近研究了下美股，发现美股的技术走势比任何品种都标准，非常符合李彪的走势终完美理论。也简单探寻了下里面潜在的短线机会，发现如@thankUcrypto 那般从1万U赚到100万U，是非常有可能的，受限于白天要炒A股，可能没法那么高频去开仓，找个时间我可能也会去尝试高收益的挑战！","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2090449674620801098"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090436938310603028","created_at":"2026-08-20T13:52:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090436938310603028"],"id":"2090436938310603028","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15955,"like_count":9,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":0},"text":"加了微信不说话的，麻烦删掉哦，有些缘分此生有且仅有一次！","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2090436938310603028"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2087747837698494509","created_at":"2026-08-13T03:47:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087747837698494509"],"id":"2087747837698494509","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":20485,"like_count":20,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"text":"很多人很好奇，为啥我每次发股票的时候，只给结论和判断，从来没有分析和理由？\n事实上炒股是1个由简入繁，再化繁至简的过程。\n10年前当分析师在第一财经分享股票，也是一堆分析和理由，现在看来更多是为了让散户相信，同时给自己立于不败之地！\n成熟的投资者总是一眼看透事务的本质，从来不拖泥带水！"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090374835931410807","created_at":"2026-08-20T09:46:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090374835931410807"],"id":"2090374835931410807","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":14758,"like_count":12,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我昨晚在群里问了一句，以太坊开拉了，现在是做多的多还是做空的多？然后群友回现在谁最空啊，结果今天好几个群友被爆。往往在行情启动的初期，之前踏空加密货币的，都会忍不住去做空，这叫补偿心理，自己期盼的抄底点位没到，看到涨了不甘心受不了，就想把比特币空下来，这种心理非常可怕，赔光几小时"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090640342693618001","created_at":"2026-08-21T03:21:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090640342693618001"],"id":"2090640342693618001","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":10373,"like_count":14,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":9},"text":"今天走势全在剧本里，科技股弱反弹，创新药分歧调整，数字货币给了局部机会，恭喜新进群的朋友们！ https://t.co/SZYNdhXKpe"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090495191023243325","created_at":"2026-08-20T17:44:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090495191023243325"],"id":"2090495191023243325","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":7045,"like_count":14,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":6},"text":"谷歌下一代 TPU 9t，计划2027‑2028 年从 3D Torus 升级为 6D Torus，单颗 TPU 光互联端口 / OCS 配比从 1.5:1 提升至 6:1，每 TPU 光模块 + OCS 价值量提升 4 倍；同时速率升级从 800G 升级至 2.4T Coherent Lite，2028 年切换 3.2T，乐观情景单 TPU 光学价值 1.37 万美元。"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2090468186638766410","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:57:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090468186638766410"],"id":"2090468186638766410","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7082,"like_count":4,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2090374835931410807","type":"quoted"}],"text":"做空加密货币建议多看看这条，别一晚上睡醒爆仓了！ https://t.co/YzZI0Y1I3w"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2087747837698494509","created_at":"2026-08-13T03:49:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087748286530957493"],"id":"2087748286530957493","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5935,"like_count":12,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2087747837698494509","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"如果你还需要一堆理由和分析来佐证，往往会掉入陷阱，好的投资和交易永远是及其简单的！"}],"users":[{"id":"928496628570427392","name":"Mcfly","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1642759051338739718/